      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "2a",
          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "Halvern Dam and the right abutment were damaged on September 9, 2025, with initial reports emerging at 16:08 UTC. On September 10, 2025, a mandatory evacuation was ordered for Brindlemark and Ferris Hollow starting at 09:25 UTC, displacing roughly 11,800 residents and raising the alert level from Yellow to Orange. By 18:58 UTC, evacuation numbers were updated to 12,400 people from Brindlemark, with additional displacements from Quennard.",
